  help: it becomes the NNNN in the staged filename, so four digits is the
        whole range there is

  x `core/absent` orders a justfile.inc it does not ship
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-collect/components/core/absent/manifest.kdl:8:1]
 7 | contributes "justfile.inc" priority=90000
 8 | contributes "justfile.inc" priority=100
   : ^^^^^|^^^^^
   :      `-- nothing to order
   `----
  help: shipping the file is what contributes it; this node only says where it
        lands

  x `core/unclaimed` ships a flatpaks.list but nothing enabled collects it
